From 783d2da3832a914074995198b5d874890ee282d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:44:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 153/162] wetmap: the delegate follows the stage's frame (S0)

Wet map (addition, docs/WETMAP_PLAN.md). HdCyclesWetState on the session
reads currentFrame and timeCodesPerSecond from the scene globals at every
render pass execution and logs each frame change with its delta in seconds.
Measured under husk --frame 1 --frame-count 3: one delegate across the three
frames, frame none -> 1, 1 -> 2 (0.0417 s), 2 -> 3, each followed by one
'Render restarted: scene'.
---
 src/hydra/CMakeLists.txt  |  2 ++
 src/hydra/render_pass.cpp |  3 +++
 src/hydra/session.h       |  5 ++++
 src/hydra/wet_state.cpp   | 49 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/hydra/wet_state.h     | 47 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 106 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/hydra/wet_state.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/hydra/wet_state.h

